      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "こ、ここが……。\nあの井戸、本当に妖怪島と繋がっていたんですね。",
      "jp_sha256": "c177adb1cd687f972bbf9239443533602350ab70e574fe1c23a9f9fdb201b7b9",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "여, 여기가…….\n저 우물, 정말로 요괴섬과 이어져 있었군요.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
